Open a second (new) file window and type in it so the file menu lists two
entries, one dirty, exercising genmenu3's file-name rendering and width calc.

-- input --
move 300 8
button 4
move 300 11
button 0
move 200 150
button 4
move 480 330
button 0
move 250 200
button 1
button 0
type abc
move 300 8
button 4
move 560 8
button 0
move 100 10
button 1
button 0
